## Mission

Break the OpenRouter generation-404 deadlock without fabricating a zero bill, dropping historical liability, regenerating retained answers, or widening financial authority.

## Mechanism

When the exact interrupted generation still returns provider HTTP 404:
- retain actual cost as UNKNOWN / null;
- quarantine the full pre-call `reservedWorstCaseUsd` as conservative economic liability;
- retain semantic authority NONE;
- preserve failed state and sealed ciphertext;
- allow the continuation checkpoint to be recovered only if the quarantine is internally consistent;
- never count the vanished response as candidate evidence;
- revalidate every other historical provider bill exactly;
- charge the quarantined liability against both the $0.45 evaluation envelope and protected Crown reserve.

Only the one missing Sol answer and one evaluator call remain eligible after separate owner authorization.

## No authority created

This patch performs no paid inference, creates no R3 owner authorization, and does not mint a Crown admission. Existing monthly runtime authority is not treated as retry authority.

OpenRouter support ticket #116019 remains external evidence lineage.

## Purpose

Hostile launch-readiness repair from exact recovered main `c49df1d0f2825512077e55708ee1e014f1fd45e2`. This PR fixes source/runtime truth defects without rebuilding solved Revenue Singularity layers or widening external-effect authority.

## Repairs included

- fixes three malformed committed test-store setters instead of excluding tests;
- separates the fixed Aug/Sep Capability Genome pilot from current-world freshness, while keeping CURRENT freshness and future-date checks fail-closed;
- pins date-sensitive Genome fixtures to explicit reference clocks;
- adds provider-neutral current collection truth: Contra selected/account-pending; XPay and Payoneer backups; PayPal deactivated; Lemon Squeezy dormant/unselected;
- removes dead PayPal/Lemon owner-work from founder launch surfaces while preserving old technical implementations for provenance;
- classifies 14 preserved unreachable modules behind explicit activation gates without activating them;
- repairs semantic donor/evidence collisions and prevents deliberately unreachable donor code from becoming current finite behavior;
- prevents the coverage index from re-admitting gated modules as operator-reachable;
- binds ENFORCED_BY_CODE coverage rows to exact source/test witnesses;
- makes Deep Atlas / Ultimate Graph scale-safe without amputating source coverage: generated evidence JSON retains full-file and chunk digests/offsets/sanitized previews while redundant derived-key recursion is skipped, and canonical digests are streamed into SHA-256;
- preserves unique PR #1250 receipts/tests before that older repair lane is retired.

## Exact hosted evidence

