- Deep Atlas: 4,262 artifacts, 4,169 parsed text files, 152,525 deep features, 10,593 content chunks, 0 truncated files;
- Ultimate Graph: 163,581 nodes, 650,318 edges, 0 orphan nodes;
- exact reachability on the full preview reported 1,047 source modules, exact partition, all classified, zero unclassified/stale classifications before that superseded build was canceled to free the verifier lane.

Final no-amputation head `623d1b4f1898c8b7975a78959b60173aae08cdd0` is undergoing fresh exact-head Vercel verification before merge.

GitHub Actions failures on this branch have repeatedly contained zero executed steps and are treated as hosted-runner infrastructure pathology, not as source passes or failures. Vercel is the independent executed-source judge.

## External-effect boundary

This repair itself performs:
- prospect/customer messages: 0
- purchases/new recurring spend: 0
- payment requests or money movement: 0
- DNS changes: 0
- credential changes: 0
